From 9d73fe9964f7017ea5c9e3696f21caaad5d87c0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cool <bilibili@att.net>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:01:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] drm/nouveau: integrate GB20B, GSP 610 and coherent
 display support

Capture the complete current Nouveau adaptation, including GB10B memory/BAR
handling, SEC2/FMC boot, R610 RM interfaces, LTC and display IOVA plumbing.
This is an imported working-tree snapshot; original per-change provenance
is not available in the local Git history.

